     // One listener drives the window orientation for every destination, so the
     // pages never race each other with their own DisposableEffect requests.
+    // Only the input page pins landscape; every other page releases the window
+    // back to the system orientation. The manifest handles the configuration
+    // changes, so a rotation never recreates the activity.
     LaunchedEffect(activity, currentRoute) {
